  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dominican Republic - Expert Consultancy Medfly Control and Eradication</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the APHIS-IICA Cooperative Agreement for Capacity Building initiated in 2014, APHIS revised the 2015 work-plan to provide agreement resources to be directed to the Dominican Republic plant health authorities to assist in the effort to control and eradicate the outbreak of Mediterranean fruit fly in the eastern region of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
